Swarm Token Prediction

benchmarks/data/prompts.json and src/swarm_token_prediction/data/tree.json
contain selected prompts and tree paths from Spec-Bench, licensed Apache-2.0,
commit fd2c1cd7d2201ef71db4c5f4e455008f017967bf.
https://github.com/hemingkx/Spec-Bench
Modifications: retained the 30 warm-up and 60 scored dev prompts in their
original benchmark order; selected 30 draft-tree paths by rank sum, depth,
and path. Provenance is recorded in those files and results/fp32/provenance.json.

The Token Recycling algorithm is described in arXiv:2408.08696.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.08696

Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct model weights are downloaded separately from Hugging Face
and are not included in this repository.
